<td id="S2.T1.5.1.20.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Secure aggregation protocols</td>
<td id="S2.T1.5.1.20.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Attack success &lt;5%</td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T1.5.1.21" class="ltx_tr">
