<th id="S3.T4.5.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">Equation (<a href="#S3.E8" title="In 3.2.2. Core Mathematical Framework ‣ 3.2. Mathematical Foundations and Theoretical Guarantees ‣ 3. Vision: Adaptive, Fair, and Scalable Federated Learning ‣ Beyond Static Knowledge Messengers: Towards Adaptive, Fair, and Scalable Federated Learning for Medical AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>)</th>
