ass="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F2.pic2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Adaptive AFFL</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>. </span><span id="S3.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance Comparison: (Left) Convergence speed showing Adaptive AFFL achieving target accuracy in 55-75% fewer rounds. (Right) Fairness improvement across institution types, with Gini coefficient reduction of 56-68%.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
