<td id="S5.T13.5.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r"><span id="S5.T13.5.4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Byzantine Robustness, Energy Efficiency</span></td></tr>
